  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-6980d5b9-7fff-2764-9568-9c35f7a71c7b&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reasons of inappropriate scale, location and detailed design would comprise an overly prominent, uncharacteristic and discordant development which would be detrimental to the character and appearance of the application site and wider terrace of which it forms part of. As such, the proposal is contrary to Policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through a design-led approach) of the London Plan (2021), LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan (LP33), and the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
